    LLM: 'Game: Buta no Shippo. Logic: Avoid collecting the central pile and finish with fewer penalty cards than the other players.',
    Player: 'Buta no Shippo is a Japanese card game in which players flip cards around a circular layout and try to avoid taking the pig-tail pile.',
    objective: 'Avoid collecting the central pile and finish with fewer penalty cards than the other players.',
    gameplay: 'Players turn cards from the circle into the centre. Matching events or special conditions force a player to take the pile, and the player with the fewest collected cards is best.',
